carla-simulator/carla (CARLA assets)
https://github.com/carla-simulator/carla

The demo map in topourbanbench/generation/crowdes/datasets/Synthetic/, the scene previews in
examples/, and the images in assets/ are derived from the CARLA town Town10HD_Opt. The terrain
images and semantic maps are RGB and semantic-segmentation camera captures from CARLA. The
walkable masks, density maps, nav meshes, and metadata are computed from them.

    CARLA specific assets are distributed under CC-BY License.
